message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "GA Layout Optimizer"
abstract: >-
  Function-preserving General Arrangement (layout) optimization from existing drawings.
  A deterministic Sequence-Pair / simulated-annealing engine searches for a smaller layout
  that keeps every space functional, and scores the as-is layout with the same objective.
